# Hosted signup destination. UNSET IS THE INTENDED STATE until signup opens:
# every CTA then renders a non-clickable "Launching soon" stub and the pricing
# card reads "Launching soon" with it, so the page can never claim availability
# above a button that cannot be clicked.
#
# Set this to the real signup URL (https://...) on the day signup opens, and
# nothing else needs to change.
#
# NOTE: NEXT_PUBLIC_POLAR_CHECKOUT_URL lived here until 2026-08-25. Polar is
# gone and nothing reads that variable any more — but it is still set in the
# site's Vercel Production environment. Delete it there when convenient.
NEXT_PUBLIC_HOSTED_SIGNUP_URL=
